OL,3,GNEWSAHeat and crowding spark Skegness
OL,4,Arail complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers travelling to Skegness in
OL,7,F30C heat have complained of
OL,8,Fovercrowding and failed air
OL,9,Fconditioning on a packed train service.
OL,11,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) said recent
OL,12,Fheatwaves had created "particularly
OL,13,Fchallenging operating conditions" and
OL,14,Fapologised to passengers affected.
OL,16,FThe complaints from passengers and an
OL,17,Fonline petition launched by Skegness
OL,18,Ftown councillor Paul Collins prompted
OL,19,FBBC News to travel on a train from
OL,20,FNottingham to Skegness to experience
OL,21,Fconditions first hand.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
